If the graph contains a cycle, all nodes in the cycle must have the same value. Furthermore, if a node $u$ is reachable from a cycle, then $x_u$ must be equal to the value of the cycle (since $x_u \le \dots \le x_{\text{cycle}} \le \dots \le x_u$). Actually, wait.
